{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Worldview]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, cockroaches will continue to evolve, and we may have to use special methods to exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you set traps for the cockroaches that inhabit various stages and exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Game Description]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player controls a robot that exterminates cockroaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>This robot can release two things: a liquid that cockroaches dislike, and a trap to exterminate them.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>The player scatters the liquid to narrow the cockroach's movement range,</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>set the trap, and wait for the cockroach to get caught.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The number of traps that can be set in each stage is limited, and they must be exterminated within the time limit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573490?t=1742646638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573490?t=1742646638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573490/2d25ce27e74bfb7683754a2f05860041b3bef678/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742646638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573490/2d25ce27e74bfb7683754a2f05860041b3bef678/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742646638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Worldview]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, cockroaches will continue to evolve, and we may have to use special methods to exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you set traps for the cockroaches that inhabit various stages and exterminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Game Description]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player controls a robot that exterminates cockroaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>This robot can release two things: a liquid that cockroaches dislike, and a trap to exterminate them.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>The player scatters the liquid to narrow the cockroach's movement range,</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>set the trap, and wait for the cockroach to get caught.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The number of traps that can be set in each stage is limited, and they must be exterminated within the time limit.</p>","developers":["iwanosaki"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573490/558806326018e661ef413b676aed55595bcc3fe9/header.jpg?t=1742646638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257117474,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117474/movie480.mp4?t=1742646627","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117474/movie_max.mp4?t=1742646627"},"name":"Insect Control_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117474/dbb0aa894db568687640431da2820ddc3a335064/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742646627","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.st